- Technical Details
    - Tech Stack:
        - Python 3.11+
        - Anthropic SDK (via Poe API)
        - Pydantic v2 for data models
        - scikit-learn for TF-IDF dedup
        - feedparser for RSS
        - httpx + BeautifulSoup for scraping
        - Jekyll for GitHub Pages site
    - Key Files:
        - run_pipeline.py: orchestrator
        - config.yaml: all configuration
        - models.py: Pydantic data models
        - llm_client.py: audited LLM wrapper
        - stages/*.py: pipeline stages
        - prompts/*.yaml: versioned prompt templates
    - Architecture Notes:
        - Each stage reads previous stage's JSON, writes its own
        - Run isolation in data/runs/{run_id}/
        - Full audit trail for every LLM call and HTTP fetch
        - Graceful degradation: each stage has fallback behavior

